taris-cli

The Caelestia CLI 1.1.3 (https://github.com/caelestia-dots/cli), by Soramane and its contributors,
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSE, next to this file). Modified
for TarisOS (https://github.com/TarisOS/tarisOS) since 2026:

- Renamed: "caelestia" becomes "taris" in every file and file name, except the licence and the
  links to the upstream project.
- apple-silicon-recording.patch: screen recording with wf-recorder on Apple Silicon Macs, where
  gpu-screen-recorder doesn't work.
- keep-icon-theme.patch: a new colour scheme keeps the icon theme picked in Settings.

The changes are in TarisOS's source, packaging/pkgbuilds/taris-cli.
